                                internet ✗

  Tailscale will let you open your Apps from your own phone, laptop or TV wherever you are, over a
  private network only your devices join.

  Not available yet
  This option is coming soon. For now your Apps stay where they are, and choosing it changes
  nothing.

  What is Tailscale?
  A service that joins your own devices into one private network, wherever they are. Only devices
  you sign in can see your Apps.

  The internet
  Your Apps stay closed to everyone else on the internet.

  Changing it later
  Everything here can be changed later in Settings, under Access.

